<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=139" title="View the profile of Falelar">Falelar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 3<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=139"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13939#msg13939"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13939#msg13939">Re: New Bitch Topic from Top Ten List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #30 on:</b> January 25, 2005, 11:33:55 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Rotations are against the Everquest/Sony Entertainment EULA that you click each time you load up Everquest. If you take the time to read it you&#039;ll find the rule sets in which you break by conforming your own &quot;rules&quot; into the game. Secondly, if anyone is caught cheating Ascent/Dol/ whoever the fuck it is report them. And feel good you did so, but have fucking proof before doing it. Wild Tangents these days just don&#039;t have the spice they used to.&nbsp; Rodcet has had enough assclowns on it for it&#039;s entire existance, won&#039;t hurt to knock a few more out from cheating.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13940"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=855" title="View the profile of Raitnar">Raitnar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 24<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/spectre.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/laretheq@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="laretheq@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=855"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13940#msg13940"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13940#msg13940">Re: New Bitch Topic from Top Ten List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #31 on:</b> January 26, 2005, 06:06:13 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Regardless of the EULA, I don&#039;t think Sony would get pissy if guild leaders had an agreement on which days each had PoTime. It isn&#039;t exactly making their own rules, just a way so everyone gets a shot without having to race and cause fights. Also, if Sony didn&#039;t want people making rules, they wouldn&#039;t include guild creation as a part of the game. Each guild has their own set of rules, so technically, all guilds break the EULA......
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13941"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=321" title="View the profile of Garadan">Garadan</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 45<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/bartmoon.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Fuck you, I know I&#039;m a asshole<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=321"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:GaradanR@netscape.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13941#msg13941"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13941#msg13941">Re: New Bitch Topic from Top Ten List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #32 on:</b> January 26, 2005, 08:01:14 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I havent been playing for a few weeks now, so whatever happened I really have no clue. Generally Ascent doesnt raid PoTime on a constant week by week schedule. Unless since I have been gone things have changed. We have gone back to raid it for apps and generally just for fun here and there. I&#039;m not gonna start sending tells asking other guilds if they are going to raid such and such a mob or zone before I call a raid. If no one else is there then that means that its a open target. You can call me a asshole for that, I really dont care. Welcome to high level raiding. As Jeet said, thats the way it has been ever since AoD came into power 5 years ago. <br /><br />This shit about warping etc... I&#039;m more then sure there are people in Ascent that have those capabilities, but dont just label it as Ascent. I can assure you that there are people in every guild that have those capabilities. Those &quot;super powers&quot; arent so secret anymore. And pretty much anyone can get a hold of it if you have any small knowledge in compiling. What does get my attention is Kinladar once again claiming he has SS of someone (no doubt me) admitting using warps. So let me clear it up here since he thinks he has a ace in his pocket. At one point in time you could summon a cleric pet and send it to a mob you had targeted, if you ran back far enough before the mob came for you, it would warp to you alone. Thats hardly using any MQ warp cheats. So Kinladar stop your bullshit about someone admitting using warps. It was a bug with the cleric pet that was used. That was what was admitted, nothing else. Further more to my knowledge I have only seen it done twice. (BTW that cleric pet shit was nerfed)<br /><br />Funny when people start running their mouth about how Ascent will let anyone join. Guess what, take a look at the server. Its dying and has been. Every upper level guild has taken in people that may not be the more popular&nbsp; kids on the totem pole of nice guys. Ascent, Conviction, EiE/DA on down the line. With the shortage of players now ( diffenetly a shortage of skilled players) as a guild leader/officer you take a head count of your active player base, open recruitment and get what you can. What your really looking for is highly skilled, active people. A reputation check is still there of course but on a lessor degree then it would of been a year ago when there was an abundance of people to pick from. And for those of you bitching about this topic, if you have never been a guild leader or officer then stfu because you have no idea what the fuck your talking about. <br /><br />I&#039;m gonna stop my ranting, this game has diffenetly lost its fun factor from what it used to be years ago. Maybe thats why people come to boards like this now to stir up shit because the game just isnt doing it for them anymore.... this board and the drama must be their viagra.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm34.gif" alt="cwm34" border="0" /><br /><br /> ~ BTW~ Who the fuck is Slayyer? 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: January 26, 2005, 08:06:02 am by Garadan</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=335131" target="_blank"><img src="http://www2.freepichosting.com/Images/421460356/4.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13942"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
