							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well none of this matters now that Ascent is officially dead!&nbsp; Good work Fysts!&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
