	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13966"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813" title="View the profile of Justyse">Justyse</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 23<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img216.exs.cx/img216/6516/convicavat44as.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Pirate pwns your tards<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/forums" title="&lt;Conviction&gt;" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tribeof3@shentel.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13966#msg13966"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13966#msg13966">Re: New Bitch Topic from Top Ten List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #37 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 09:08:20 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think our problem with the whole Time day issue was that we have had ZERO problem working out days with 3 guilds now. None what so ever. FoT, EiE/DA, and RoS have all been respectful and civil in dealing with us, and I assume eachother about a rotation in Time.<br />That rotation allows guilds to set up a raid schedule for their players, many of which have real lives, jobs, school, kids etc and like to be able to semi plan their attendance.<br />If another guild had become Time flagged, we would have offered to work out a schedule with them as well. Because WE give a shit about our rep and our relations with other guilds on the server. We dont like to tromp on other people. A simple tell is all it would have taken, but obviously that was too much to ask.<br /><br />I personally contacted Gara and was as polite as I could be, but was stone walled and the blame was set on Fysts since &quot;he sets up the raids, I havent been on in a few days&quot;. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bullshit.gif" alt="Bull Shit!" border="0" /><br />I know there have been a couple small incidents in Qvic with EiE the past week or two as well, very lame. But I&#039;m sure EiE has better fish to fry than Qvic anyhow <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> Theyve proved that with their outstanding performances in the upper GoD zones the past 2 weeks! /cheer<br /><br />I KNOW that not every member of ascent approved of these type of jackass moves, but it sure was a horrible reflection on the guild as a whole and a very sad way for the guild to go out after they had had such a long career being seen as a great guild.<br />I wish things had been different. Good luck wherever you choose to go.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635046" target="_blank"><img src="http://img89.exs.cx/img89/4849/justygl24ky.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13970"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=200" title="View the profile of Eelyen">Eelyen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								The Overmind<br />
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 171<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.fotguild.com/images/avatars/eelavatar.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Overmind<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=200"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.fotguild.com" title="Fires of Time Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13970#msg13970"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13970#msg13970">Re: New Bitch Topic from Top Ten List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #38 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 10:09:21 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I don&#039;t think it puts any discredit on Ascent.  That is how they have always been.  It&#039;s how the original designers of the game wanted it in some small manner.  Competition makes the game fun, racing is fun.  All the instanced crap has ruined the game.<br /><br />Ascent just followed the same ideals it always had.  The only guild FoT ever worked out a deal with while I was leader was Conviction and Forsaken.  Conviction was just a small unofficial backflagging agreement.  And I would of broken that on a Xegony raid if most of my officers hadn&#039;t wanted me to back off.   Forsaken was a time rotation, just because we had so much bad blood in the past and with the way time was, it was convenient.  <br /><br />But when it came to everything else, when you look back when it was Ascent, Eie/da, Arirang, Anth/FoT, and Forsaken around.  It was all First Come, First Serve for pretty much everything.  And it was enjoyable...for the most part :P  And yes, I had my share of frustration and arguements, but I still look back on it as the most fun I had in the game.<br /><br />The top 10 list is sort of pointless now.  With everything being instanced, the only thing that really seperates guild is their having enough people to hit raid targets on a consistant basis.  Skill is important too, of course.  The lack of any real competition has removed a very enjoyable part of the game for a long time now.<br /><br />I salute Ascent for staying true to the end.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: January 27, 2005, 10:17:46 am by Eelyen</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Sage Eelyen of the Nexus<br />Overmind of Fires of Time<br />Proud Member of the RNRH
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13981"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 384<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13981#msg13981"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13981#msg13981">Re: New Bitch Topic from Top Ten List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #39 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 01:40:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I&#039;ve been stupified for years how people think the top guilds are 100% model citizens,</div><br />Eh, I knew a lot of people who thought everyone in the top gulids were assholes, too.&nbsp; So it goes both ways and of course it&#039;s no more accurate than thinking they&#039;re all model citizens.<br /><br />Eelyen, the vast majority of players I&#039;ve ever talked to about it absolutely despise having to race for spawn.&nbsp; A small minority, mostly in the top few raid guilds, always liked it.&nbsp; Most everyone else felt that a game making the hardest part of beating an encounter actually finding the damn mob up and getting to it first was utterly retarded.&nbsp; &nbsp;The devs would be fools to still be catering primarily to a small minority.<br /><br />As for Time, well, sure a guild doesn&#039;t break any game rules by ignoring the rotation.&nbsp; But when 3 guilds have a fair system worked out that avoids conflict with each other, and another guild comes in and ignores the arrangement, they&#039;re naturally going to piss off the first 3 guilds.&nbsp; At that point they either care about being on good terms with other guilds or they don&#039;t.&nbsp; If they care, they at least attempt to work something out that&#039;s agreeable to all.&nbsp; If they don&#039;t, okay, but they shouldn&#039;t be surprised when others justifiably call them inconsiderate assholes.&nbsp; <br /><br />Of course it&#039;s all a mute point as Ascent disbands...
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
