							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Anything in the world is determined on time. The more time you have the better you are at something. So the more time you put into something the better chance you have at being the best. If you spend all day everyday working at your job you will be the best in your position. If you spend all day smoking weed and playing guitar you may become the best player in the world. Time is everything, and people make it out to have no impact at all. <br />
